  "ingredients": [
    "16 ounce boneless, skinless chicken thighs",
    "1/4 cup grated parmesan cheese",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "1 teaspoon paprika",
    "1 teaspoon italian seasoning",
    "4 tablespoon unsalted butter (divided)",
    "400 gram cauliflower (riced)",
    "1/2 medium onion (chopped)",
    "2 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1 medium lemon (juice + zest)",
    "1/4 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes",
    "1/4 teaspoon fresh parsley (chopped)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-chicken-with-parmesan-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53861-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Chicken-with-Parmesan-Cauliflower-Rice-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "On a plate, combine the parmesan cheese, minced garlic, paprika, and Italian seasoning.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-chicken-with-parmesan-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53861-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Chicken-with-Parmesan-Cauliflower-Rice-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season the chicken with the mixture made. Season with salt and pepper to taste. Add butter to a frying pan and heat on medium to high heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-chicken-with-parmesan-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53861-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Chicken-with-Parmesan-Cauliflower-Rice-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add butter to a frying pan and heat on medium to high heat. Cook the chicken on both sides until golden brown and cooked thoroughly. Remove from pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-chicken-with-parmesan-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53861-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Chicken-with-Parmesan-Cauliflower-Rice-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the same pan, add butter to the pan. Fry the garlic and onion for 30 seconds to 1 minute until translucent.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-chicken-with-parmesan-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53861-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Chicken-with-Parmesan-Cauliflower-Rice-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the riced cauliflower to the pan. Stir to combine well and cook for about 1 minute.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-chicken-with-parmesan-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53861-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Chicken-with-Parmesan-Cauliflower-Rice-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in half of the parsley and zest of a lemon. Cook for 1-2 minutes. Add the lemon juice. Stir well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-chicken-with-parmesan-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53861-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Chicken-with-Parmesan-Cauliflower-Rice-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the rest of the parsley and stir well to combine.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-chicken-with-parmesan-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53861-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Chicken-with-Parmesan-Cauliflower-Rice-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the chicken over to the frying pan on top of the cauliflower rice.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-chicken-with-parmesan-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53861-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Butter-Chicken-with-Parmesan-Cauliflower-Rice-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the cauliflower rice and chicken breasts with a slice of lemon. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/butter-chicken-with-parmesan-cauliflower-rice/#wprm-recipe-53861-step-0-9",
